---@field createTime? string Output only. The timestamp when the resource was created.
---@field trustConfig? string Optional. A reference to a TrustConfig resource from the certificatemanager.googleapis.com namespace. This is a relative resource path following the form "projects/{project}/locations/{location}/trustConfigs/{trust_config}". A BackendService uses the chain of trust represented by this TrustConfig, if specified, to validate the server certificates presented by the backend. Required unless wellKnownRoots is set to PUBLIC_ROOTS.
---@field clientCertificate? string Optional. A reference to a certificatemanager.googleapis.com.Certificate resource. This is a relative resource path following the form "projects/{project}/locations/{location}/certificates/{certificate}". Used by a BackendService to negotiate mTLS when the backend connection uses TLS and the backend requests a client certificate. Must have a CLIENT_AUTH scope.
---@field wellKnownRoots? gcp.networksecurity_v1.BackendAuthenticationConfigWellKnownRootsEnum Well known roots to use for server certificate validation.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The timestamp when the resource was updated.
---@field etag? string Output only. Etag of the resource.
